      "widgets_values": [
        "Google Flow through the useapi.net API (third-party, not affiliated with Google).\n\nBefore you queue:\n1. Get a useapi.net API token: https://useapi.net/docs/start-here/setup-useapi?utm_source=comfyui&utm_medium=workflow\n2. Connect your Google account once: https://useapi.net/docs/start-here/setup-google-flow?utm_source=comfyui&utm_medium=workflow\n3. Set USEAPI_TOKEN before starting ComfyUI, or put the token in ComfyUI/user/useapi_token.txt.\n\nOmni 1.2 Flash text to video: 3 to 10 s on any plan, up to 15 s on a paid Google AI plan; 360p or 720p. Videos are saved to output/useapi-google-flow."
